# .claudeignore — Claude Code ignore patterns
# Docs: https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/settings#claudeignore
#
# Same syntax as .gitignore. Files matching these patterns are hidden from Claude Code's
# file tools (Read/Write/Edit/Grep/Glob) and from the context it sees.
# Use this to keep secrets, build artifacts, and junk out of the model's reach.
#
# Examples:
#   .env
#   .env.*
#   secrets/
#   *.pem
#   node_modules/
#   dist/
#   build/
#   __pycache__/
#   *.pyc
#   .DS_Store
#   Thumbs.db
